      <section id="getting-started" class="help-sec">
        <h2><i class="bi bi-compass"></i> {{t 'hf.sGettingStarted'}}</h2>
        <p>Aegis SA is a security assessment &amp; authorization (SA&amp;A) platform. You sign in as an
          <b>assessor / administrator</b> or as an invited <b>project member</b>; multi-factor authentication
          (MFA) is available and can be enforced org-wide. After signing in you land on your <b>Dashboard</b>,
          which summarises your projects, active assessments, pending audits, authorizations, intakes and
          pre-assessments.</p>
        <ul>
          <li><b>Administrators</b> see the full workspace and every project in their organization.</li>
          <li><b>Project members</b> see only the projects and assessments they're assigned to.</li>
          <li><b>Language</b> — switch anytime from the globe menu (top right); the whole UI is available in
            8 languages.</li>
        </ul>
      </section>

